  {
    "screen": "timeaudit-usage-energy-04",
    "orientation": "h",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "从哪里开始",
        "align": "left",
        "size": "medium"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "在 TimeAudit 的屏幕使用看板选日期或时间段看时间；用电和电费在功耗看板，“累计能耗、电费与碳排放”和“应用能耗、每日趋势与峰谷分析”两组点“展开”才计算。要完整时段的活动证据，可请有当前个人资料权限的 AI 使用 TimeAudit 的只读活动摘要入口，明确给出起止时间。",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "40%"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "row": "start",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "60%",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **只计算落在所选日期里的时间**　系统把跨过午夜的睡眠和离开时段裁到查询范围内，避免“今天用电脑超过一天”。",
        "row": "start",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
  },
